WEBVTT

00:07.160 --> 00:08.920
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:34.960 --> 01:38.920
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:42.040 --> 01:45.160
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

01:45.240 --> 01:48.080
LONGEVITY

01:49.880 --> 01:52.200
‎-That's amazing.
‎-Right.

01:52.280 --> 01:53.320
Come.

01:58.080 --> 01:59.600
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

02:00.600 --> 02:01.520
Come.

02:01.600 --> 02:02.920
-Try this.
-It's delicious.

02:14.840 --> 02:16.160
Wonderful.

02:21.200 --> 02:24.600
Lady Xie, what do you think
is the thickest thing in the world?

02:25.760 --> 02:27.880
I'd say some people's skin.

02:28.760 --> 02:30.840
No blade can cut it,
no arrow can pierce it.

02:30.920 --> 02:33.760
How else could they commit
so many vile deeds

02:33.840 --> 02:34.880
and still smile as if nothing happened,

02:35.720 --> 02:37.280
without a shred of shame?

02:38.280 --> 02:40.560
Lady Xie said she was too ill to come.

02:41.160 --> 02:43.920
But you asked her several times,
and insisted her to attend.

02:45.360 --> 02:46.840
So that's Xie Hualou.

02:47.640 --> 02:49.520
She looks much thinner than before.

02:50.120 --> 02:51.480
Are you feeling better now?

02:51.560 --> 02:54.760
Don't you know what made Lady Xie ill?

02:54.840 --> 02:57.480
She had the misfortune of crossing
a vicious, treacherous woman

02:58.160 --> 02:59.920
who nearly cost her life.

03:00.000 --> 03:03.080
From what she's saying,
could it be her cousin-in-law?

03:03.160 --> 03:04.680
Don't go accusing people blindly.

03:04.760 --> 03:07.480
Attempted murder is punishable by hanging.

03:08.240 --> 03:11.000
Hualou, you mustn't let a moment of mercy

03:11.080 --> 03:13.000
allow evil to fester and bring more harm.

03:16.120 --> 03:18.880
It is still the seventh month,
and the heat hasn't let up.

03:18.960 --> 03:21.440
I'm afraid the young ladies can't bear it.

03:22.280 --> 03:24.320
They've seen
this entertainment many times.

03:25.240 --> 03:27.760
Why not let them take a walk

03:28.280 --> 03:30.360
and enjoy the grounds
of the Duke's Residence?

03:31.280 --> 03:34.880
Heat? I'd say someone's hiding
a guilty conscience.

03:35.600 --> 03:37.680
Her plot failed, and now she's ashamed.

03:38.600 --> 03:42.480
Old Madam Xie, why would you say that?

03:42.560 --> 03:43.920
Our Xie family

03:44.000 --> 03:46.080
has done everything to protect
the Duke's reputation.

03:47.160 --> 03:49.440
We have no wish to shatter the jade vase
in pursuit of a rat.

03:49.520 --> 03:52.280
Otherwise,
I'd have gone straight to the Wei family

03:52.360 --> 03:53.400
and demanded justice.

03:54.160 --> 03:56.480
So why keep pretending you know nothing?

03:59.640 --> 04:02.080
Brother. What exactly is going on?

04:02.680 --> 04:04.800
From what I can see,
something seems a little off.

04:21.000 --> 04:21.839
Bring it in.

04:27.760 --> 04:29.400
-What's going on?
-What is it?

04:29.480 --> 04:30.400
Here comes a cool breeze.

04:31.560 --> 04:33.720
I've never seen anything like this before.

04:34.880 --> 04:36.080
Interesting.

04:36.680 --> 04:38.440
LONGEVITY

04:42.400 --> 04:43.800
It really does fill
the hall with a breeze.

04:43.880 --> 04:45.160
It's so cool, my arms are getting chilly.

04:45.240 --> 04:46.600
Brother, you're brilliant.

04:46.680 --> 04:47.920
With this wind wheel,

04:48.000 --> 04:51.040
the room is filled
with refreshing lotus fragrance.

04:51.120 --> 04:52.240
What a clever contraption.

04:52.840 --> 04:54.760
Brother, you've kept this well hidden.
Only showing it to us now?

04:55.520 --> 04:57.240
This summer has been unbearably hot.

04:57.840 --> 04:59.600
And the ladies
are all dressed formally for the banquet.

05:00.200 --> 05:02.240
Rao feared the ladies
may fall victim to heatstroke

05:02.880 --> 05:04.560
so she had the finest craftsmen make it.

05:05.280 --> 05:07.480
The palace craftsmen
have made seven-bladed fans before.

05:07.560 --> 05:09.640
-But…
-It really is impressive.

05:09.720 --> 05:10.560
She is very thoughtful,

05:11.520 --> 05:13.120
always attentive to the smallest details.

05:15.600 --> 05:18.040
How unusual. Brother is always so stern.

05:19.040 --> 05:21.000
When have we ever heard him praise anyone?

05:21.080 --> 05:24.080
It seems he's quite pleased
with his new wife.

05:28.000 --> 05:31.280
This spinning-wheel-style wind wheel
was inspired by a farm winnowing fan.

05:31.360 --> 05:34.240
Farmers use its airflow
to blow away the chaff,

05:34.320 --> 05:35.480
making it much easier to winnow grain.

05:35.560 --> 05:38.640
Qingtong told me

05:38.720 --> 05:40.040
Grandmother has been unwell in the heat,

05:40.120 --> 05:42.560
listless and weary with no appetite.

05:43.520 --> 05:46.320
So I asked My Lord
to have someone make this.

05:46.880 --> 05:48.840
Thankfully, it was ready
for the birthday banquet,

05:48.920 --> 05:52.200
so our guests won't have
to suffer in the heat.

05:52.280 --> 05:56.240
I've seen a fan like this
at a farm's threshing ground.

05:56.320 --> 05:59.520
I never knew it could be used this way.

05:59.600 --> 06:04.000
I wonder how all seven blades
are linked together.

06:05.840 --> 06:07.320
What a good girl.

06:07.840 --> 06:11.200
Lu Zhuo, you've married
such a devoted and virtuous wife.

06:12.040 --> 06:14.920
You must have earned
this blessing in a past life.

06:15.720 --> 06:18.640
My dear, I must thank you as well.

06:18.720 --> 06:21.200
When the Lu family was in dire straits,

06:21.280 --> 06:23.040
you entrusted this blessed girl
to our family.

06:24.120 --> 06:26.320
She is not only Lu Zhuo's lifesaver,

06:26.400 --> 06:29.200
also a blessing to our entire family.

06:29.800 --> 06:31.800
You're too kind, Old Madam Lu.

06:31.880 --> 06:34.400
She's still young. Such praise

06:35.240 --> 06:37.600
might bring her more fortune
than she can bear.

06:38.120 --> 06:41.560
How many people
ever get a second chance at life?

06:41.640 --> 06:44.560
Lord Lu owes it all
to marrying such a blessed wife.

06:45.600 --> 06:46.640
Indeed.

06:50.120 --> 06:52.640
My Lady, the Xie family
may attend the banquet too.

06:53.440 --> 06:54.480
I'm worried…

06:54.560 --> 06:55.400
THE XIE AND HAN FAMILIES ARE SWORN ENEMIES

06:56.000 --> 06:57.360
There's no avoiding them.

06:58.200 --> 07:01.600
I'll bear the consequences
of Wei Rao's mistakes.

07:01.680 --> 07:03.840
But as long as Lord Lu

07:04.720 --> 07:06.880
cares about the Duke's reputation

07:08.000 --> 07:10.280
and wishes his grandmother to enjoy
the birthday banquet,

07:11.080 --> 07:12.000
he

07:13.800 --> 07:15.920
will be my strongest shield.

07:20.680 --> 07:21.520
Move them to both sides.

07:23.120 --> 07:24.160
Come.

07:44.720 --> 07:46.480
On the Duchess's birthday banquet,

07:46.560 --> 07:49.080
even the slightest slip
will be the talk of the town.

07:49.160 --> 07:50.440
Rest assured, Madam.

07:50.520 --> 07:53.560
That whole box of butterflies
has been smothered to death.

07:53.640 --> 07:56.520
She'll disgrace herself
before everyone at the banquet.

08:01.400 --> 08:02.800
Mother,

08:03.320 --> 08:06.840
I heard your granddaughter-in-law
won't follow tradition this year.

08:06.920 --> 08:09.840
She plans to release butterflies
for your birthday.

08:09.920 --> 08:12.680
Look, she even brought in a lotus vat.

08:13.400 --> 08:15.720
Soon, at this banquet,

08:15.800 --> 08:18.880
lights blazing, lotuses blooming,

08:18.960 --> 08:20.360
butterflies fluttering everywhere.

08:21.120 --> 08:24.120
Truly an ingenious and delightful idea.

08:24.720 --> 08:27.400
Butterflies? Open it! Hurry!

08:28.000 --> 08:30.840
The air holes in that bamboo box
look far too small.

08:30.920 --> 08:32.200
On such an auspicious day,

08:32.280 --> 08:34.559
we mustn't let
any living creature suffocate.

08:34.640 --> 08:37.120
Quick. Let them out at once.

08:37.200 --> 08:38.480
Hurry, let them out.

08:39.600 --> 08:42.400
Grandmother, if I may,
please open it yourself.

09:13.080 --> 09:14.640
The butterflies really suffocated?

09:15.400 --> 09:17.960
A joyous day
has turned into needless killing.

09:18.040 --> 09:20.600
It'll cost blessings and longevity.
How awful!

09:20.680 --> 09:21.760
Exactly.

09:21.840 --> 09:23.800
They all suffocated in the box.

09:24.560 --> 09:25.960
That's a terrible omen.

09:26.560 --> 09:28.080
She should've just followed tradition.

09:28.680 --> 09:30.080
But no, she had to do something different.

09:30.680 --> 09:33.000
And look at the bad luck it's brought.

09:33.800 --> 09:36.080
The Duchess despises
the killing of living creatures.

09:36.160 --> 09:37.280
She'll be furious.

09:46.920 --> 09:49.440
This is… a fire lighter?

09:58.440 --> 09:59.280
Bring it in.

10:42.360 --> 10:44.520
Those… Those aren't butterflies!

10:45.120 --> 10:46.960
Then why were you catching butterflies?

10:47.560 --> 10:50.720
Third Aunt,
living creatures are meant to be free.

10:50.800 --> 10:51.720
Why catch them just to release them?

10:52.360 --> 10:53.280
Besides, butterflies may be beautiful,

10:53.360 --> 10:54.800
but the powder on their wings
can be harmful.

10:54.880 --> 10:57.640
Butterflies left the dew-gathering maids
with red and swollen eyes.

10:57.720 --> 10:59.120
I merely had them driven away.

11:00.480 --> 11:02.440
She refused to have it brought in openly.

11:02.520 --> 11:05.560
she meant for everyone
to guess what's in the box.

11:06.440 --> 11:07.840
Cheeky move, I'll say that.

11:12.320 --> 11:13.400
Grandmother.

11:13.920 --> 11:15.840
This lamp is called Everfull.

11:16.600 --> 11:19.680
Everfull means
may your years be ever full.

11:19.760 --> 11:24.440
May you live
a long, healthy, peaceful life.

11:25.360 --> 11:28.040
You're awfully young
to make such a grand promise.

11:28.120 --> 11:30.400
How can a mere lamp promise peace?

11:31.160 --> 11:33.360
There were meant to be 108 lamps,

11:33.960 --> 11:35.800
corresponding to 108 worries.

11:35.880 --> 11:38.000
Once they're burned away,
Grandmother will be worry-free.

11:41.240 --> 11:43.480
And this one has…

11:43.560 --> 11:45.040
60 lamps?

11:45.120 --> 11:48.160
Yes. Grandmother shall light it yourself.

11:48.680 --> 11:51.760
For each year you gain,
let one more lamp be added.

11:52.280 --> 11:54.920
One year after another,
until there are 108 lamps.

11:55.000 --> 11:57.160
That would be true and endless blessings.

11:59.840 --> 12:01.560
You sweet-talking child.

12:02.240 --> 12:05.320
Do you expect me to live past 100?

12:05.400 --> 12:06.680
I'd be an old fossil by then!

12:07.560 --> 12:10.520
-She's joking.
-So it's a centennial lamp.

12:10.600 --> 12:12.680
What an auspicious sign.

12:12.760 --> 12:14.120
Far more than 100 years.

12:14.200 --> 12:17.320
Since ancient times,
108 has meant perfect fulfillment.

12:17.400 --> 12:19.840
It's called 108,
but it wishes for a boundless longevity.

12:19.920 --> 12:21.640
What a thoughtful idea.

12:22.600 --> 12:25.600
Every wick on this lamp was made
by Wei Rao from lamp paper

12:25.680 --> 12:27.240
and twisted by hand.

12:27.320 --> 12:28.960
It shows her heartfelt devotion.

12:31.920 --> 12:35.840
Mother was kind enough to spare me
from most of the household affairs,

12:35.920 --> 12:39.160
so I had time to personally
prepare this gift for Grandmother.

12:39.240 --> 12:40.640
Good.

12:43.720 --> 12:44.560
It's the least I can do.

12:59.360 --> 13:00.560
Grandmother, please light the lamp.

13:01.280 --> 13:02.120
All right.

13:42.240 --> 13:45.440
-It's beautiful.
-It is.

13:54.080 --> 13:56.520
My Lord. General Qi
and the Han family are fighting.

14:05.520 --> 14:06.360
Look.

14:06.960 --> 14:09.560
Han Liao, today is a joyous day
for the Duke's family.

14:09.640 --> 14:10.840
Making trouble again?

14:10.920 --> 14:11.960
Get out of my way!

14:12.040 --> 14:13.720
You have a death wish?

14:14.240 --> 14:15.080
Stop.

14:18.640 --> 14:20.480
Lord Lu, forgive the disturbance.

14:21.000 --> 14:24.040
Zhuo, I had barely arrived
when he came looking for trouble.

14:24.120 --> 14:26.640
I came to deliver a birthday gift
on behalf of my mother,

14:27.240 --> 14:29.200
and got attacked the moment I arrived.

14:29.840 --> 14:32.080
Everyone here saw it.

14:32.160 --> 14:35.280
General Qi attacked me without asking.

14:36.640 --> 14:37.720
Lord Lu,

14:38.880 --> 14:40.720
is this how the Lu family
treats its guests?

14:41.960 --> 14:43.400
So what if I attack?

14:43.480 --> 14:45.800
Back when we marched on Hutuo,
you were supposed to back us up.

14:45.880 --> 14:48.280
When things got bad, you delayed
and refused to dispatch troops

14:48.360 --> 14:49.200
almost cost us the war.

14:49.960 --> 14:52.000
-You deserved every blow!
-Enough!

14:54.600 --> 14:57.160
A guest is a guest once they're
through the door. For my sake,

14:57.800 --> 15:00.480
No fighting tonight. Don't make a scene.

15:00.560 --> 15:04.560
Out of respect for Lord Lu,
I'll let this brute off.

15:09.800 --> 15:11.360
The Duke sent word.

15:11.440 --> 15:13.520
He wants you
in the front courtyard to receive guests.

15:14.160 --> 15:15.760
The Marquis of Pingxi
heard General Qi had arrived

15:16.360 --> 15:17.880
and wants you there
to help with the drinking.

15:18.520 --> 15:19.920
Lady Rao came dressed for the occasion…

15:20.000 --> 15:21.160
-I…
-I'll go now.

15:24.440 --> 15:25.320
Lord Han.

15:31.480 --> 15:33.880
My mother acquired a precious mirror
from the Western Regions.

15:33.960 --> 15:37.040
She insisted I present it
to the Duchess myself.

15:40.440 --> 15:42.920
I'll first pay my respects
to the birthday lady,

15:43.000 --> 15:44.160
present the gift, and toast.

15:44.840 --> 15:46.240
Then I'll join you at the banquet.

15:46.320 --> 15:48.760
Please apologize to the Duke for me.

15:48.840 --> 15:50.160
Tell him I'll be there shortly.

15:51.560 --> 15:52.920
Rest assured, Lord Lu.

15:53.960 --> 15:55.360
I was also born into a noble family.

15:55.440 --> 15:57.480
My conduct reflects my family's honor.

15:57.560 --> 16:00.880
Causing trouble at a birthday banquet
would only make me a laughingstock.

16:01.400 --> 16:05.160
At least I know how to behave,
unlike some people.

16:08.120 --> 16:09.520
I'll show our guest the way.

16:09.600 --> 16:11.720
Lord Han, please.

16:22.040 --> 16:24.000
-Thank you. This way.
-All right.

16:24.080 --> 16:26.120
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

16:26.200 --> 16:27.040
Lord Huo.

16:30.400 --> 16:31.840
Please inform Her Ladyship

16:31.920 --> 16:35.320
that Huo Jue, on Lady Shou'an's orders,
has brought a Nuo opera troupe

16:35.400 --> 16:37.440
to celebrate the Duchess's birthday.

16:38.040 --> 16:39.880
Lord Huo,
please have some tea in the hall.

16:39.960 --> 16:41.040
I'll report your arrival at once.

16:43.040 --> 16:44.960
-Let's go.
-This way.

16:52.320 --> 16:53.560
Your Ladyship, a moment.

16:56.000 --> 16:58.480
I hear Lord Lu's old wound
still hasn't healed.

16:59.480 --> 17:01.600
My family has a healer

17:01.680 --> 17:03.200
who's highly skilled at treating wounds.

17:03.280 --> 17:06.240
Her family's Dragon Bone Wound Powder
is unmatched.

17:07.599 --> 17:08.440
Madam Liu.

17:08.520 --> 17:09.560
Yes!

17:21.400 --> 17:24.319
Madam Liu,
pay your respects to Her Ladyship.

17:25.200 --> 17:28.400
Greetings, Lady… Lady Lu.

17:36.760 --> 17:39.800
What is it? Do you know this woman?

17:51.680 --> 17:53.680
Lord Lu was wounded
fighting for the realm.

17:54.360 --> 17:56.760
His Majesty has asked
about his recovery many times.

17:56.840 --> 17:59.360
Therefore, Lord Lu's health

17:59.440 --> 18:01.560
has always been overseen
by imperial physicians.

18:02.160 --> 18:06.200
Only senior physicians skilled
in medicine, acupuncture, and surgery

18:06.280 --> 18:09.240
with 20 years of practice
are permitted to come here.

18:09.880 --> 18:10.960
Lord Han, may I ask

18:11.560 --> 18:13.760
where did you find this quack?

18:13.840 --> 18:16.240
And you dare bring her here so brazenly?

18:16.320 --> 18:17.520
What?

18:18.600 --> 18:21.480
Do you think so little
of His Majesty's imperial physicians?

18:22.160 --> 18:23.960
Or do you look down on the Lu family?

18:27.280 --> 18:29.640
Or are you plotting to harm Lord Lu?

18:33.400 --> 18:35.880
You insolent old woman!
How dare you stare at the noble lady?

18:36.800 --> 18:39.240
Forgive me! I wouldn't dare.

18:39.320 --> 18:41.720
Didn't you say Her Ladyship
looked like someone you once knew?

18:42.880 --> 18:44.600
Look up and take a good look.

18:55.280 --> 18:58.200
Her figure does look somewhat similar.

19:03.360 --> 19:06.360
But the young woman I knew

19:06.440 --> 19:08.440
was just a night-soil woman.

19:09.600 --> 19:12.120
She was filthy,
with matted hair and a dirty face,

19:12.200 --> 19:14.040
and wouldn't wash her face for months.

19:14.120 --> 19:18.520
No one even knew
what she really looked like.

19:18.600 --> 19:22.760
Compared to this elegant young lady,

19:22.840 --> 19:26.360
she was a firefly beside the moon,

19:26.440 --> 19:28.160
a crow beside a phoenix.

19:28.240 --> 19:29.680
How could they possibly compare?

19:30.560 --> 19:32.680
That's not what you told me before!

19:34.440 --> 19:35.480
A what?

19:38.280 --> 19:39.720
Lord Han, what did you compare me to?

19:39.800 --> 19:44.040
My Lady, she said a night-soil woman.

19:45.880 --> 19:47.120
You… How dare you!

19:48.480 --> 19:50.200
How dare you compare me
to a night-soil woman!

19:51.040 --> 19:51.880
There must be some misunderstanding.

19:55.000 --> 19:56.320
Guards, see them out!

19:56.960 --> 19:58.360
You filthy vermin!

19:58.440 --> 20:00.720
Your vile nonsense has deeply insulted me.

20:01.240 --> 20:03.120
If my maternal grandmother were here,

20:03.640 --> 20:05.040
she'd have torn your mouth apart by now!

20:05.880 --> 20:08.480
Bitao, throw this old beggar out!

20:08.560 --> 20:09.680
Yes.

20:10.240 --> 20:12.520
Someone, have Lu Zhuo come here!

20:12.600 --> 20:13.840
-Lord Han!
-He brought this vile guest here.

20:13.920 --> 20:14.760
-Lord Han!
-He can deal with her himself.

20:14.840 --> 20:17.880
-I only did what you told me!
-You wretched thing.

20:17.960 --> 20:19.600
-Lord Han!
-Lady Wei Rao!

20:20.120 --> 20:21.000
Lord Han!

20:23.600 --> 20:25.800
Even her wit and temper have style.

20:26.560 --> 20:28.520
What a shame she's married
to that prude Lu Zhuo.

20:28.600 --> 20:30.880
Such a pity.

20:32.320 --> 20:34.080
Lord Han, I'll show you the way.

20:35.320 --> 20:38.320
There are many ladies in the garden.
We mustn't disturb them.

20:39.680 --> 20:41.120
Wait here.

20:41.200 --> 20:42.680
There's no need to follow.

20:45.920 --> 20:47.720
What are you doing? I…

20:50.080 --> 20:52.720
This is outrageous!

20:52.800 --> 20:54.200
The mighty Duke's Residence

20:54.280 --> 20:58.200
is bullying a helpless old widow like me!

20:59.280 --> 21:01.880
You're hurting me!

21:02.400 --> 21:04.160
My lady has a kind heart.

21:04.240 --> 21:06.880
She knows you're a fraud
with bad intentions,

21:06.960 --> 21:10.040
but she won't tarnish
the Lu family's reputation for charity.

21:10.120 --> 21:10.960
Here.

21:11.040 --> 21:13.880
A bag of millet so you won't go hungry.
And no more swindling people.

21:15.120 --> 21:16.120
Behave yourself.

21:30.560 --> 21:31.480
My Lady.

21:32.320 --> 21:33.560
Is everything delivered?

21:34.080 --> 21:35.320
Yes.

21:36.120 --> 21:37.880
Madam doesn't want
to see that unwelcome guest.

21:37.960 --> 21:39.080
Go tell Dowager Lady

21:39.680 --> 21:42.880
-that my Lady went back to change.
-Yes.

21:47.880 --> 21:49.360
Thank goodness she saw it.

21:52.160 --> 21:53.440
Thank goodness she understood.

21:54.480 --> 21:56.320
Seeing the begonia hairpin
means seeing me.

21:56.400 --> 21:57.920
Madam Liu, please help me.

21:58.960 --> 22:01.520
I'll repay you generously
for today's favor.

22:07.720 --> 22:09.040
It's mine! Don't take it!

22:13.400 --> 22:14.960
Give it to me! Let go!

22:28.320 --> 22:29.480
Good girl.

22:29.560 --> 22:32.440
Looks like I didn't teach you in vain.

22:32.960 --> 22:36.680
"If you make it big, don't forget me"
was your very first lesson.

22:37.360 --> 22:39.280
When Madam Liu was 14,

22:39.360 --> 22:41.720
a wicked neighbor sold her to a brothel.

22:42.320 --> 22:43.520
Her working name was Begonia.

22:44.920 --> 22:47.320
Proud of her beauty,
she thought highly of herself.

22:48.160 --> 22:50.200
Even there,
she always had to outdo the others.

22:50.800 --> 22:53.320
She took every client
she could to please the madam,

22:55.000 --> 22:57.880
all for fine clothes,
good food, and a life of pleasure.

22:58.480 --> 23:00.880
Until her beauty faded
and she fell gravely ill.

23:02.360 --> 23:04.280
The madam turned on her
and tried to bury her alive.

23:04.360 --> 23:05.640
Only then did she finally wake up.

23:06.720 --> 23:09.040
She taught me my first song.

23:09.560 --> 23:11.960
She taught me to hide
my face beneath grime

23:12.680 --> 23:14.760
and patiently wait
for my chance to escape.

23:16.640 --> 23:19.840
You see, the people who taught me

23:21.320 --> 23:23.040
were either lowly courtesans,

23:24.120 --> 23:25.840
down-and-out scholars,

23:27.000 --> 23:29.200
some family's despised concubine,

23:29.760 --> 23:32.200
or wastrels
who'd squandered their fortunes.

23:32.920 --> 23:35.920
They never fought each other
over petty gains.

23:36.920 --> 23:38.160
And yet, they were also the ones

23:40.040 --> 23:42.600
who taught me so many valuable things.

23:43.560 --> 23:45.000
Like what?

23:45.600 --> 23:49.440
Lessons they only learned
after being beaten down by this world.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.520
You need nerve

23:52.960 --> 23:54.400
before you can claim you're right.

23:58.560 --> 23:59.520
My Lady.

24:00.040 --> 24:01.240
I'm fine.

24:01.960 --> 24:04.200
I could barely eat at the banquet,

24:04.840 --> 24:06.360
and then I had to face Han Liao.

24:07.360 --> 24:08.640
My chest hurts a little.

24:09.720 --> 24:13.440
It's stomach pain.
You've been so busy lately,

24:13.520 --> 24:16.080
always on edge and worrying too much.

24:17.040 --> 24:18.400
Let me help you back to rest.

24:20.400 --> 24:21.600
Your Ladyship.

24:23.560 --> 24:24.480
Your Ladyship.

24:25.000 --> 24:26.760
Lady Shou'an sent
the Huo family's eldest son

24:26.840 --> 24:28.200
to wish Old Madam a happy birthday.

24:28.720 --> 24:32.480
He even brought a Nuo opera troupe.
He's waiting in Jiangyun Hall.

24:35.640 --> 24:37.320
Understood. You may go.

24:38.120 --> 24:39.000
Yes.

24:48.960 --> 24:50.880
I got past Xie Hualou.

24:53.000 --> 24:55.000
I got past Han Liao too.

24:57.880 --> 24:59.400
As for Huo Jue…

25:01.360 --> 25:03.680
I'll get past him too.

25:04.280 --> 25:06.680
Lord Huo is Lady Rao's cousin.

25:07.320 --> 25:09.440
He knows her temperament
and habits very well.

25:10.040 --> 25:13.120
I can find a way to send him away.
Shall we?

25:20.480 --> 25:22.160
He's here for me.

25:25.480 --> 25:27.080
JIANGYUN HALL

25:32.880 --> 25:35.680
We won't need any of you here.
You may all leave.

25:35.760 --> 25:37.400
JIANGYUN HALL

25:59.080 --> 26:02.600
GALAXY OF VERSES

26:05.160 --> 26:06.000
Rao.

26:06.880 --> 26:08.000
Brother Jue.

26:08.720 --> 26:09.800
It's been a long time.

26:16.840 --> 26:18.680
You do look somewhat like her.

26:19.360 --> 26:21.040
But your nature and manner differ greatly.

26:22.160 --> 26:23.400
The moment you spoke,

26:23.480 --> 26:25.600
I knew you weren't her.

26:27.680 --> 26:28.640
Bitao.

26:29.640 --> 26:32.280
My cousin brought a Nuo opera troupe
for the birthday celebration.

26:33.920 --> 26:36.680
Go check
if everything is properly arranged.

26:38.120 --> 26:38.960
Yes.

26:48.000 --> 26:50.280
Know how I saw through you
at first glance?

26:51.040 --> 26:52.840
My little cousin

26:52.920 --> 26:54.880
was the proudest lady in the world.

26:55.480 --> 26:56.800
Ever since we were children,

26:57.320 --> 26:58.840
unless she needed a favor,

26:59.600 --> 27:02.880
whenever she saw me,
she'd call me by name.

27:02.960 --> 27:04.760
She'd never sweetly call me "Brother Jue."

27:05.880 --> 27:08.000
After all, everyone doted on her.

27:08.080 --> 27:10.080
She had every reason
to look down on the world.

27:14.760 --> 27:16.000
But you?

27:16.680 --> 27:19.000
A woman of the lowest birth,

27:19.760 --> 27:23.600
someone even ordinary people
would go out of their way to avoid.

27:25.400 --> 27:27.000
You aren't even fit to hold her stirrup,

27:27.920 --> 27:29.520
much less take her place.

27:30.200 --> 27:33.680
You're just a cheap imitation,
making a fool of yourself.

27:34.560 --> 27:36.160
The estate is packed
with guests right now.

27:36.240 --> 27:37.360
Everyone is watching.

27:38.560 --> 27:39.600
So here's some friendly advice.

27:39.680 --> 27:42.600
Admit the truth before I expose you.

27:43.600 --> 27:45.440
Give back everything that isn't yours.

27:45.520 --> 27:49.160
Maybe I'll let you live.

27:53.240 --> 27:55.360
Who decides my life to be worthless?

27:56.400 --> 28:00.200
Who decides the fates to be rich or poor,

28:00.920 --> 28:03.120
the lives to be insignificant or noble?

28:04.360 --> 28:06.080
What gives anyone the right to decide?

28:09.080 --> 28:11.880
Virtue? Yet in this world,

28:11.960 --> 28:15.880
some people are rotten to the core
and still live in luxury.

28:15.960 --> 28:19.000
Some commit every evil imaginable
and are still made generals and lords!

28:19.840 --> 28:22.920
Heaven is blind. Heaven is unjust!

28:24.360 --> 28:27.600
It cast me into the mud from birth

28:27.680 --> 28:30.320
and expects me to rot there forever.

28:32.800 --> 28:33.720
No.

28:34.960 --> 28:36.640
Even if it's Heaven itself,

28:39.440 --> 28:41.120
it has no right.

28:41.720 --> 28:43.120
No one can beat fate!

28:43.640 --> 28:46.760
You were born lowly.
How dare you covet what was never yours?

28:46.840 --> 28:49.720
If Heaven wants me in the mud,
then I'll defy Heaven itself!

28:50.880 --> 28:52.800
I'll either win or die.

28:53.600 --> 28:55.400
I'm not even afraid of Heaven.

28:57.640 --> 28:58.840
You think I'm afraid of you?

28:59.440 --> 29:01.320
Don't keep fooling yourself.

29:01.400 --> 29:04.800
Leave the Lu family with me now.
Give back everything you've taken.

29:04.880 --> 29:06.760
I ensure you a life of wealth and peace.

29:07.920 --> 29:08.760
You're…

29:11.200 --> 29:12.040
Lying.

29:14.600 --> 29:16.640
Back when I crawled on the ground,

29:17.800 --> 29:20.400
countless noblemen's boots
trampled my hands.

29:21.320 --> 29:23.040
That's when I learned

29:23.680 --> 29:26.080
That look you get when you're lying.

29:26.160 --> 29:29.920
I saw through your lofty,
hypocritical, scheming faces.

29:30.600 --> 29:33.200
Don't think your sweet talk can fool me.

29:33.800 --> 29:37.600
If you truly meant to spare me,
you wouldn't have walked in here

29:38.200 --> 29:40.040
trying to humiliate and threaten me.

29:41.320 --> 29:44.800
If I believed you and walked out of here.

29:46.160 --> 29:48.160
I'd be dead in the street by tomorrow.

29:50.520 --> 29:53.080
Weren't you going to expose me? Go ahead!

29:53.680 --> 29:55.520
Take it all the way
to His Majesty if you want.

29:55.600 --> 29:57.520
All of you shall go down with me.

30:00.800 --> 30:02.200
Anything else to say, Brother Jue?

30:03.240 --> 30:04.320
If not,

30:05.840 --> 30:06.920
I'll be back to the banquet.

30:08.400 --> 30:09.240
Stop!

30:10.640 --> 30:13.040
You're the bravest woman I've ever met.

30:14.400 --> 30:17.200
There's nothing
you won't dare think or do.

30:18.320 --> 30:20.480
If you're willing to risk everything,

30:21.600 --> 30:23.280
what can I possibly do to you?

30:24.120 --> 30:25.280
Stay a little longer.

30:26.160 --> 30:27.200
Let's talk this through.

30:53.240 --> 30:54.920
You knew I was a schemer and a hypocrite.

30:55.000 --> 30:57.160
You should've been more careful.

30:58.200 --> 30:59.120
Too bad.

31:04.240 --> 31:05.600
I gave you my word,

31:05.680 --> 31:07.160
and I never break it.

31:09.080 --> 31:11.440
Huo Jue, kill her.

31:16.440 --> 31:17.600
This isn't the place.

31:32.040 --> 31:34.080
Then I'll carve

31:35.880 --> 31:38.440
a dozen cuts into her face

31:39.120 --> 31:43.720
and see if she still dares impersonate me.

31:45.520 --> 31:46.880
Han Liao didn't deliberately
cause trouble, did he?

31:46.960 --> 31:48.040
Give who trouble?

31:49.280 --> 31:50.400
Her Ladyship isn't at the banquet.

31:50.480 --> 31:51.960
Her maternal family,
the Zhous, sent someone.

31:52.040 --> 31:55.200
But Lady Shou'an rarely has dealings
with the capital's noble families.

31:55.280 --> 31:57.760
Yet she specifically asked her cousin
to meet her in Jiangyun Hall.

31:59.120 --> 31:59.960
Cousin?

32:09.680 --> 32:12.200
My Lord, please wait.
I need to speak with you.

32:14.920 --> 32:20.040
JIANGYUN HALL

32:24.640 --> 32:25.680
Hurry.

32:31.840 --> 32:33.640
I've always admired you

32:33.720 --> 32:36.120
as a man who knows right from wrong
and puts justice above personal ties.

32:36.200 --> 32:39.560
But you know fully well
that Wei Rao pushed me.

32:39.640 --> 32:41.120
Why are you covering for her?

32:41.200 --> 32:43.200
Just because she's your wife,

32:43.280 --> 32:45.480
she can ignore right and wrong
and twist the truth?

32:45.560 --> 32:47.360
Do you know that at the banquet,

32:47.440 --> 32:49.440
if I hadn't spared the Duke's family

32:49.520 --> 32:51.400
and exposed her in front of everyone,

32:51.480 --> 32:54.720
her reputation would've been ruined
across the capital.

32:58.040 --> 32:59.080
What are you laughing at?

32:59.160 --> 33:01.440
That day,
aside from Xie and Wei family servants,

33:02.040 --> 33:03.600
there was no one else in the pavilion.

33:05.720 --> 33:07.200
That's why Old Madam Xie
only dared to make veiled accusations.

33:08.080 --> 33:09.360
That's the real issue.

33:09.960 --> 33:11.680
So you weren't protecting
the bigger picture.

33:11.760 --> 33:12.960
You were simply weighing the risks.

33:13.800 --> 33:16.680
Wei Rao is the Duke's new daughter-in-law.

33:16.760 --> 33:18.560
She is my lawful wife.

33:19.800 --> 33:21.520
Family comes before outsiders.

33:22.200 --> 33:23.680
Even if she has made mistakes,

33:24.280 --> 33:26.000
you shouldn't use them
as an excuse to stop me,

33:26.600 --> 33:30.000
unless you meant to provoke Wei Rao
into losing control in public

33:30.080 --> 33:31.200
and making even more mistakes.

33:32.120 --> 33:34.800
So you're saying I'm an outsider,
with no right to question your wife

33:34.880 --> 33:37.080
or interfere in your marriage?

33:37.760 --> 33:41.280
If Wei Rao is wrong,
I'll correct her and counsel her.

33:42.840 --> 33:44.160
You needn't concern yourself
with her anymore.

33:48.760 --> 33:50.000
I was wrong about you.

34:00.040 --> 34:00.880
Let's go.

34:17.520 --> 34:18.679
Don't blame me.

34:18.760 --> 34:21.199
Once we make it safely through tonight,
I'll hand her over to you.

34:21.800 --> 34:22.840
You can do whatever you want with her.

34:24.080 --> 34:27.239
I'll go to the banquet first.
Rao, follow the plan.

34:27.760 --> 34:28.679
Understood.

34:29.400 --> 34:30.239
I'll go ahead.

34:30.320 --> 34:33.600
JIANGYUN HALL

34:50.280 --> 34:51.560
Dowager Lady has asked twice already.

34:51.639 --> 34:54.960
Go to Jiangyun Hall and tell Her Ladyship
must return to the banquet at once.

34:55.040 --> 34:56.080
Yes.

35:00.400 --> 35:02.080
Come on, come on!

35:02.160 --> 35:03.280
Place your bets!

35:03.360 --> 35:04.280
-Come on!
-Place your bets!

35:04.360 --> 35:05.240
-I'm betting odd!
-Bet on what?

35:05.320 --> 35:07.040
-I'm betting even!
-Odd or even?

35:07.120 --> 35:11.560
-Even!
-Odd!

35:14.280 --> 35:15.480
-Again!
-I'm betting even!

35:15.560 --> 35:17.320
-Odd!
-I'm all in!

35:19.840 --> 35:21.200
My maternal grandmother
went home for the ancestral rites

35:21.280 --> 35:23.040
and couldn't make it to the banquet.

35:23.120 --> 35:26.040
She asked me to bring
a highly skilled Nuo opera troupe

35:26.680 --> 35:28.160
to offer the Duchess

35:28.240 --> 35:31.160
blessings, good fortune, and long life.

35:31.760 --> 35:32.680
Wonderful.

35:33.560 --> 35:35.560
Lady Xie, look!

35:35.640 --> 35:37.560
They're performing
a Nuo dance for blessings.

36:01.520 --> 36:04.800
She never returned to the banquet.
Where else could she have gone?

36:24.880 --> 36:25.720
What a beautiful dance.

37:26.720 --> 37:27.960
‎Her Ladyship!

37:29.040 --> 37:30.240
‎It is Her Ladyship.

37:30.320 --> 37:31.160
Rao!

37:34.120 --> 37:35.880
Bravo! Bravo!

37:35.960 --> 37:38.280
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

37:40.360 --> 37:41.880
As your granddaughter-in-law,
I offer this dance

37:41.960 --> 37:43.280
to honor you on your birthday.

37:43.360 --> 37:45.960
May Heaven bless you
with joy, harmony, and good fortune.

37:46.840 --> 37:50.080
May you enjoy endless blessings,
long life, and perfect health.

37:51.280 --> 37:52.480
-Wonderful!
-It's Rao!

37:52.560 --> 37:54.000
Rao was the one dancing.

37:55.520 --> 37:57.520
She really put her heart into this.

37:58.520 --> 38:00.080
She even kept it a secret from all of us.

38:00.160 --> 38:01.920
With such striking makeup,

38:02.000 --> 38:03.480
she looks like
a completely different person.

38:04.680 --> 38:06.320
No wonder her dance was beautiful,

38:06.400 --> 38:08.560
yet her movements looked different
from everyone else's.

38:08.640 --> 38:10.000
So it was Rao!

38:15.680 --> 38:17.400
Then I'll carve

38:17.920 --> 38:19.400
a dozen cuts into her face

38:20.600 --> 38:24.480
and see if she still dares impersonate me.

38:30.200 --> 38:32.680
You can't kill her
and stain Jiangyun Hall with blood.

38:32.760 --> 38:33.920
There will be no hiding from it.

38:34.920 --> 38:36.880
Your tempers and manners
are completely different.

38:36.960 --> 38:38.160
Even if you change makeup and clothes,

38:38.240 --> 38:39.320
anyone paying attention
will see through you.

38:40.280 --> 38:43.120
We need a way to distract everyone

38:43.200 --> 38:44.360
so no one has time to notice.

38:46.360 --> 38:48.840
Brother Jue,
you really are a cunning merchant.

38:49.680 --> 38:51.000
You're incredibly devious.

38:52.640 --> 38:56.400
A cunning merchant will do anything
to make sure you get what you want.

38:57.480 --> 39:00.680
After all, years ago,
I gave your mother my word.

39:01.680 --> 39:04.520
At the banquet later,
you must be extremely careful.

39:04.600 --> 39:05.800
Don't make a single mistake.

39:11.280 --> 39:12.920
Rao can do this too?

39:23.000 --> 39:26.160
Forgive me, Old Madam. I slipped.

39:26.240 --> 39:27.600
I'm afraid I've spoiled everyone's fun.

39:35.080 --> 39:36.240
They say

39:36.320 --> 39:38.200
Nuo dance
can connect mortals with the divine.

39:38.280 --> 39:41.800
Yesterday, I was blessed to see
the Queen Mother descend upon Penglai

39:41.880 --> 39:42.720
to hold a lotus feast.

39:43.320 --> 39:45.280
She took a sacred lotus
from Mount Taihua's Jade Well.

39:46.360 --> 39:49.320
Its bloom spanned 100 feet,
its root as large as a boat.

39:49.400 --> 39:51.440
It was cold as frost
and sweeter than honey.

39:51.520 --> 39:53.920
They say Peng Zu
ate just one slice of its root

39:54.000 --> 39:56.120
and lived for 800 years.

39:57.160 --> 39:59.760
So I quickly plucked one lotus petal

39:59.840 --> 40:02.040
and hid it in my robe.

40:02.120 --> 40:03.120
When I suddenly awoke,

40:03.920 --> 40:06.600
I was on a boat,
drifting through a lotus pond.

40:07.200 --> 40:10.560
But in my hand,
I was somehow clutching a lotus.

40:12.200 --> 40:14.360
Really? What happened next?

40:15.640 --> 40:16.880
This is that very lotus.

40:18.160 --> 40:21.400
The Queen Mother knew our Grandmother

40:21.480 --> 40:24.400
was kind, generous, and compassionate.

40:24.480 --> 40:26.840
So she bestowed this sacred lotus

40:27.360 --> 40:28.880
upon Grandmother

40:28.960 --> 40:31.800
to bless you with fortune,
health, and a long life.

40:33.680 --> 40:35.560
Wonderful!

40:35.640 --> 40:37.280
-Well said!
-Wonderful!

40:37.960 --> 40:39.800
-Indeed.
-Wonderful!

40:41.120 --> 40:43.720
Rao, you really went all out

40:43.800 --> 40:46.480
to celebrate my birthday.

40:46.560 --> 40:49.000
-What a sweet girl.
-Indeed.

40:49.080 --> 40:52.680
You've made this old woman
truly delighted.

40:52.760 --> 40:53.760
Come.

40:56.440 --> 40:57.880
Come, everyone.

40:58.720 --> 41:01.600
Everyone, raise your cups.

41:01.680 --> 41:02.640
Let's celebrate this night together.

41:02.720 --> 41:03.800
Cheers.

41:03.880 --> 41:05.880
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

41:20.600 --> 41:23.640
Lady Rao's Nuo dance
was quite something, wasn't it?

41:25.440 --> 41:26.600
Where's Han Liao?

41:27.240 --> 41:28.080
Han Liao?

41:29.200 --> 41:31.400
Right. When did that man sneak away?

41:32.280 --> 41:33.480
I didn't even notice.

41:36.760 --> 41:38.600
Thank you, Brother Jue,

41:38.680 --> 41:39.960
for bringing the Nuo dance
as a birthday gift

41:40.560 --> 41:42.680
and making me look so good.

41:42.760 --> 41:43.840
Unfortunately,

41:43.920 --> 41:45.320
-the Western Region incense you gave me
-It's fascinating.

41:45.400 --> 41:46.520
-is far too strong and gaudy.
-I'll show you again next time.

41:47.400 --> 41:49.000
It's not really to my taste.

41:51.160 --> 41:52.800
It's you.

41:54.080 --> 41:55.200
Impossible. You clearly…

41:56.560 --> 41:58.040
How could it be you?

42:01.120 --> 42:02.240
Lady Rao organized the birthday banquet,

42:02.320 --> 42:03.800
and someone's jealousy
got the better of them.

42:03.880 --> 42:05.480
They locked her
in a room in the east wing.

42:05.560 --> 42:08.880
My Lord isn't at the banquet.
I'm afraid a fuss would cause gossip.

42:08.960 --> 42:10.800
I had no choice but to ask for your help.

42:11.640 --> 42:12.880
Get out!

42:24.800 --> 42:25.760
My Lady.

42:29.760 --> 42:30.800
General Qi…

42:38.360 --> 42:40.040
Then… Where's Jundai?

42:42.640 --> 42:44.800
I accidentally broke
the Han family's gift.

42:44.880 --> 42:47.080
He had his men carry it
back just as it was.

42:47.160 --> 42:51.440
Maybe he borrowed that large chest.

42:52.920 --> 42:54.960
-You wretched thing.
-Lady Wei Rao.

42:55.040 --> 42:57.880
Wait here. Don't follow me.

43:02.520 --> 43:04.800
My Lady, they are the Han family's men.

43:04.880 --> 43:05.880
Understood.

43:05.960 --> 43:07.920
JIANGYUN HALL

43:24.240 --> 43:25.800
-Come on! Hurry!
-I'm betting even again.

43:25.880 --> 43:27.240
Odd. I'm betting odd.

43:27.320 --> 43:28.520
-I'm betting odd.
-Even!

43:28.600 --> 43:30.440
-Open it!
-Even!

43:30.520 --> 43:31.560
-Even!
-Odd!

43:50.480 --> 43:51.400
What a wonderful night.

44:05.800 --> 44:07.320
-What's wrong?
-This is bad.

44:09.240 --> 44:12.280
My dear, your granddaughter

44:12.360 --> 44:15.320
is truly the finest young lady
in the world.

44:15.400 --> 44:17.240
You raised her well.

44:17.320 --> 44:19.200
Come, let me toast you.

44:19.840 --> 44:21.440
After tonight,

44:21.520 --> 44:23.840
who in the capital won't know

44:23.920 --> 44:25.800
this wonderful young lady

44:25.880 --> 44:30.880
has just married into your Lu family?

44:32.840 --> 44:33.880
Come.

44:39.480 --> 44:41.920
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

44:42.000 --> 44:43.640
You don't need to see me any farther.

44:44.560 --> 44:47.720
My child, you did very well.

44:48.600 --> 44:51.040
No one could have done better.

44:51.640 --> 44:52.560
Go on back.

44:53.680 --> 44:54.880
Grandmother.

44:56.320 --> 44:59.160
I hear a distant cousin
has come from our hometown

44:59.800 --> 45:02.360
who looks so much like me.
It's hard to tell us apart.

45:02.960 --> 45:04.760
With her here to keep you company,

45:04.840 --> 45:06.640
I can leave with peace of mind.

45:07.160 --> 45:11.600
But she's unfamiliar with this place
and can be rather impulsive.

45:12.120 --> 45:14.680
Please look after her

45:15.200 --> 45:18.520
and keep her from stumbling into trouble.

45:22.800 --> 45:23.800
Don't worry.

45:25.040 --> 45:25.920
Go on back.

45:37.400 --> 45:38.240
First Aunt.

45:42.040 --> 45:42.880
Take care.

45:56.800 --> 46:00.400
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

46:06.240 --> 46:07.280
Let's go back.

46:14.280 --> 46:16.120
I'll go get the medicine
and be right back.

46:24.520 --> 46:25.560
Who are you, exactly?

48:52.320 --> 48:54.640
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
